OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-social behaviour powers are
OL,4,Aworking - jeweller
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city centre jeweller says he has seen
OL,7,Fa significant improvement in the area
OL,8,Fsince new powers to tackle anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour were introduced last April.
OL,11,FLeicester City Council brought in the
OL,12,Fpublic spaces protection order (PSPO),
OL,13,Fgiving wardens the power to issue #100
OL,14,Ffines for offences, including
OL,15,Faggressive begging, street drinking,
OL,16,Fand the dangerous riding of electric
OL,17,Fbikes and scooters.
