OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-social behaviour powers are
OL,4,Aworking - jeweller
OL,5,
OL,6,FDominic Gomersall, who runs Lumbers
OL,7,Fjewellery shop, said businesses
OL,8,Freopening and the presence of safety
OL,9,Fofficers were signs the city centre was
OL,10,Fimproving.
OL,12,FCity mayor Sir Peter Soulsby said while
OL,13,Fprogress had been made in reducing
OL,14,Fanti-social behaviour, there was still
OL,15,F"work to do".
